  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'Now a reaction. Place a Molecular Synthesizer on the glowing tile below
      the stream, downstream of the vents. Its arrows face the water too: it takes
      what its recipe needs as the stream passes, lets everything else float on,
      and drops what it makes back in.'
